  14               IFNDEF CPU <CPU=4>
  15                       /FILL IN 1 FOR PDP-8/E (ALSO 8/F, 8/M)
  16                       /FILL IN 2 FOR PDP-8/A (WITH CORE MEMORY)
  17                       /FILL IN 4 FOR PDP-8/I OR OLD PDP-8
