  19               IFNDEF OS8 <OS8=20>
  20                       /FILL IN 10 TO RUN UNDER OS/8
  21                       /FILL IN 20 FOR PAPER TAPE INPUT ONLY
  22               
  23               IFNDEF CORE <CORE=100>
  24                       /FILL IN 100 FOR 4K SYSTEM (PAPER TAPE ONLY)
  25                       /FILL IN 200 FOR 8K OR LARGER SYSTEM
  26                       /FILL IN 400 FOR 12K OR LARGER SYSTEM
  27                       /(ENABLES SPECIAL PLAYER)
  28               
  29               IFNDEF NOISE <NOISE=IOF>
  30                       /FILL IN THE SINGLE CYCLE INSTRUCTION WHICH IS
  31                       /TO BE USED TO CREATE NOISE.  FOR 8/E OR 8/A WITHOUT
  32                       /AN RX01, TRY CAF.  FOR OTHER SYSTEMS, TRY IOF.
  33                       /DO NOT USE AN INSTRUCTION WHICH TAKES LONGER
  34                       /THAN 1.5 MICROSECONDS.
